design/community-directions.html

# THE OWNER GUIDE IS A DELIVERABLE, NOT PART OF THE APP.
#
# docs/owner-guide/ holds the PDF, its screenshots, the pitch text and - the
# reason this entry exists - join-qr.png, which encodes a working 500-use
# club join code. Committed 2026-09-16 and live at
# https://haimunia-app.pages.dev/docs/owner-guide/join-qr.png within the hour,
# because this deploy publishes the repository root verbatim.
#
# That is a straight violation of this project's one standing rule: no
# credential is ever committed, because every committed file is a public URL.
# The files stay on disk and are sent to the owner directly; they do not go
# back into git. _redirects blocks the path as well, so the two have to fail
# together for this to recur.
docs/owner-guide/

# Scratch extraction tooling for the src/community/ split, run from outside the
# repo. The root IS the website, so nothing unreviewed belongs here even when
# functions/_middleware.js already 404s it.
/_*.mjs
